324.     ///
325.     /// # Description
326.     ///
327.     /// Allocates the next fixed-size slot and reinterprets it as `MaybeUninit<T>`.
328.     ///
329.     /// # Returns
330.     ///
331.     /// On success, returns a mutable reference to an uninitialized `T`.
332.     ///
333.     /// # Errors
334.     ///
335.     /// - [`BumpAllocError::SizeMismatch`] if `size_of::<T>() != N`.
336.     /// - [`BumpAllocError::AlignmentMismatch`] if `align_of::<T>() > A`.
337.     /// - Any error from [`alloc()`](Self::alloc).
